Subject: [PATCH 07/19] HIP GCN: RMS norm at decode sizes

The row held in registers (16-byte loads), one wave for rows up to 512 and 4 waves for wider ones, DPP
reduction plus one shared-memory step. MI25, Gemma 4 12B story at temperature 0: 34.4 -> 35.2-35.4 t/s.
GGML_CUDA_RMS_GCN=0 turns it off.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TS8XWm5bp2cWmYvbQ5tTBK
---
